    <div>
      <h2>The clinic</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire Univet Saint-Raphaël, at 37 avenue Frédéric Mistral, is part of the Univet network. It treats cats, dogs and exotic pets and, according to its page, is a short walk from the Bernard Ricci car park. The page mentions access for disabled people and the coach station 100 m away (buses). A vet on the team is presented as Fear Free certified.</p>

      <h2>Hours and emergencies</h2>
      <p>By appointment only: Monday to Friday 9am to 1pm then 2pm to 7pm, Saturday 9am to 1pm, closed on Sunday (clinic page on univet.fr, read on 08/11/2026). For an emergency outside opening hours, the clinic refers you to Univet Cannes Carnot (04 93 99 33 39) or UVD 83 (04 89 88 34 34); it does not provide a night on-call service itself.</p>
      <p>Appointments are made by phone on 04 94 95 93 52 or online from the clinic's page.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save the clinic's number and those of the two emergency services on your phone as soon as you arrive in Saint-Raphaël.</div>
    </div>

